rtermaster Donaldo is easy to spot. A large man with a blond beard and a tricorne hat, he faces the wave-like feature and stares at it longingly. You take a spot beside him and look in the same direction, imagining the waves springing to life like those of a sea no land lover could really replicate.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.32,"end":19.2,"frac":0.912,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":57},"large":{"start":0.32,"end":19.2,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":54,"words":57},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"\"Captain,\" Donaldo says, not taking his eyes off the fake waves. This was someone who needed back on a ship, stat.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":20.032,"end":28.32,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":21},"large":{"start":20.032,"end":28.416,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You sailed with Donaldo before, seemingly a lifetime ago. He held the helm during storms, and fought like a madman in boarding raids. You ask him what he misses most about being out at sea.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":29.152,"end":41.28,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":35,"words":35},"large":{"start":29.152,"end":41.28,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":35,"words":35},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92bfb6d712_PC%20JM9.png"}